      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232956/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press dough into an ungreased 11½x7½-inch jelly roll pan until evenly spread. Prick dough all over with a fork to prevent puffing while it bakes. Sprinkle sugar over the top.",
